docs {
  # Create Series

  새 시리즈를 생성합니다.

  ## Request Body

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | studyId | number | **Yes** | Study ID |
  | seriesInstanceUid | string | No | DICOM Series Instance UID (자동 생성 가능) |
  | modality | string | No | 모달리티 (US, CT, MR, etc.) |
  | seriesNumber | number | No | 시리즈 번호 |
  | seriesDescription | string | No | 시리즈 설명 |
  | bodyPartExamined | string | No | 검사 부위 (HEART, CHEST, BRAIN, etc.) |
  | manufacturer | string | No | 장비 제조사 |
  | manufacturerModelName | string | No | 장비 모델명 |

  ## Request Example

  ```json
  {
    "studyId": 1,
    "seriesInstanceUid": "1.2.840.113619.2.1.1.20260108",
    "modality": "US",
    "seriesNumber": 1,
    "seriesDescription": "4 Chamber View",
    "bodyPartExamined": "HEART",
    "manufacturer": "GE Healthcare",
    "manufacturerModelName": "VIVID E95"
  }
  ```

  ## Response

  ### Success (201)
  ```json
  {
    "code": 201000,
    "message": "Created",
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "uuid": "01936b6c-1234-7abc-def0-123456789abc",
      "studyId": 1,
      "studyDescription": "Echocardiogram",
      "patientName": "Hong Gildong",
      "seriesInstanceUid": "1.2.840.113619.2.1.1.20260108",
      "modality": "US",
      "seriesDescription": "4 Chamber View",
      "bodyPartExamined": "HEART",
      "manufacturer": "GE Healthcare",
      "manufacturerModelName": "VIVID E95",
      "seriesNumber": 1,
      "numberOfInstances": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-01-08T10:30:00",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-08T10:30:00",
      "tenantId": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ### Error (404) - Study Not Found
  ```json
  {
    "code": 404000,
    "message": "Study not found",
    "data": null
  }
  ```
}
